{
  "matthew.14.p1.b1": {
    "text": "そのころ、領主ヘロデはイエスのうわさを聞いて、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p1.b2": {
    "text": "あれはバプテスマのヨハネだ。死人の中からよみがえったのだ。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p1.b3": {
    "text": "それで、あのような力が彼のうちに働いているのだ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p2.b1": {
    "text": "ヘロデは先に、自分の兄弟ピリポの妻ヘロデヤのことで、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p2.b2": {
    "text": "ヨハネを捕えて縛り、獄に入れていた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p2.b3": {
    "text": "その女をめとるのは、よろしくない",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p2.b4": {
    "text": "そこでヘロデはヨハネを殺そうと思ったが、群衆を恐れた。彼らがヨハネを預言者と認めていたからである。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p3.b1": {
    "text": "さてヘロデの誕生日の祝に、ヘロデヤの娘がその席上で舞をまい、ヘロデを喜ばせたので、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p3.b2": {
    "text": "彼女の願うものは、なんでも与えようと、彼は誓って約束までした。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p3.b3": {
    "text": "すると彼女は母にそそのかされて、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p3.b4": {
    "text": "バプテスマのヨハネの首を盆に載せて、ここに持ってきていただきとうございます",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p4.b1": {
    "text": "王は困ったが、いったん誓ったのと、また列座の人たちの手前、それを与えるように命じ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p4.b2": {
    "text": "人をつかわして、獄中でヨハネの首を切らせた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p4.b3": {
    "text": "その首は盆に載せて運ばれ、少女にわたされ、少女はそれを母のところに持って行った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p5.b1": {
    "text": "それから、ヨハネの弟子たちがきて、死体を引き取って葬った。そして、イエスのところに行って報告した。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p5.b2": {
    "text": "イエスはこのことを聞くと、舟に乗ってそこを去り、自分ひとりで寂しい所へ行かれた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p5.b3": {
    "text": "しかし、群衆はそれと聞いて、町々から徒歩であとを追ってきた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p6.b1": {
    "text": "イエスは舟から上がって、大ぜいの群衆をごらんになり、彼らを深くあわれんで、そのうちの病人たちをおいやしになった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p6.b2": {
    "text": "夕方になったので、弟子たちがイエスのもとにきて言った、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p6.b3": {
    "text": "ここは寂しい所でもあり、もう時もおそくなりました。群衆を解散させ、めいめいで食物を買いに、村々へ行かせてください",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p6.b4": {
    "text": "彼らが出かけて行くには及ばない。あなたがたの手で食物をやりなさい",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p7.b1": {
    "text": "わたしたちはここに、パン五つと魚二ひきしか持っていません",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p7.b2": {
    "text": "それをここに持ってきなさい",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p7.b3": {
    "text": "そして群衆に命じて、草の上にすわらせ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p7.b4": {
    "text": "五つのパンと二ひきの魚とを手に取り、天を仰いでそれを祝福し、パンをさいて弟子たちに渡された。弟子たちはそれを群衆に与えた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p8.b1": {
    "text": "みんなの者は食べて満腹した。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p8.b2": {
    "text": "パンくずの残りを集めると、十二のかごにいっぱいになった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p8.b3": {
    "text": "食べた者は、女と子供とを除いて、おおよそ五千人であった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p9.b1": {
    "text": "それからすぐ、イエスは群衆を解散させておられる間に、しいて弟子たちを舟に乗り込ませ、向こう岸へ先におやりになった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p9.b2": {
    "text": "そして群衆を解散させてから、祈るためひそかに山へ登られた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p9.b3": {
    "text": "夕方になっても、ただひとりそこにおられた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p10.b1": {
    "text": "ところが舟は、もうすでに陸から数丁も離れており、逆風が吹いていたために、波に悩まされていた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p10.b2": {
    "text": "イエスは夜明けの四時ごろ、海の上を歩いて彼らの方へ行かれた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p10.b3": {
    "text": "幽霊だ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p10.b4": {
    "text": "しっかりするのだ、わたしである。恐れることはない",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p11.b1": {
    "text": "主よ、あなたでしたか。では、わたしに命じて、水の上を渡ってみもとに行かせてください",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p11.b2": {
    "text": "おいでなさい",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p11.b3": {
    "text": "ペテロは舟からおり、水の上を歩いてイエスのところへ行った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p12.b1": {
    "text": "しかし、風を見て恐ろしくなり、そしておぼれかけたので、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p12.b2": {
    "text": "主よ、お助けください",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p12.b3": {
    "text": "イエスはすぐに手を伸ばし、彼をつかまえて言われた、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p12.b4": {
    "text": "信仰の薄い者よ、なぜ疑ったのか",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p13.b1": {
    "text": "ふたりが舟に乗り込むと、風はやんでしまった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:32"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p13.b2": {
    "text": "舟の中にいた者たちはイエスを拝して、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p13.b3": {
    "text": "ほんとうに、あなたは神の子です",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p14.b1": {
    "text": "それから、彼らは海を渡ってゲネサレの地に着いた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p14.b2": {
    "text": "するとその土地の人々はイエスと知って、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p14.b3": {
    "text": "その附近全体に人をつかわし、イエスのところに病人をみな連れてこさせた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p15.b1": {
    "text": "そして彼らにイエスの上着のふさにでも、さわらせてやっていただきたいとお願いした。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:36"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "matthew.14.p15.b2": {
    "text": "そしてさわった者は皆いやされた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Matthew 14:36"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  }
}
